# same-run visual baselines: whiteboardResize.ts writes these on every run
# (Screenshot A) and compares the post-resize state against them within the
# same run, so committed copies are dead weight that git sees as modified
# after each execution
whiteboard/whiteboard.spec.ts-snapshots/mod-whiteboard-resize-initial-*.png
